{"text": "The only ones who were pleased were the Snow and the Frost. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Spring has forgotten this garden, they cried, so we will live here all year. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Snow covered the grass, and the Frost painted the trees silver. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then they invited the North Wind and the Hail to stay with them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I cannot understand why the Spring is so late in coming, said the Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the Spring never came, and the Summer did not come either. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Autumn gave golden fruit to every garden, but she gave none to his. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He is too selfish, she said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One morning the Giant was lying in bed when he heard lovely music. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was only a little linnet singing outside his window. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He looked out of the window and saw a wonderful sight.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "o", "n", "e", "s", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "p", "l", "e", "a", "s", "e", "d", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "S", "n", "o", "w", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "F", "r", "o", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "p", "r", "i", "n", "g", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", "f", "o", "r", "g", "o", "t", "t", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "c", "r", "i", "e", "d", ",", " ", "s", "o", " ", "w", "e", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", " ", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "S", "n", "o", "w", " ", "c", "o", "v", "e", "r", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "a", "s", 